  "view": "<section class=financial-management-container><nav class=page-index aria-label='Navegação financeira'><a id=financial-clients-index class=root-index>Clientes</a><span aria-hidden=true>›</span><a id=financial-client-index class=root-index><span id=financial-client-name>Nome do cliente</span></a><span aria-hidden=true>›</span><p>Financeiro</p></nav><header class=financial-title><span class=financial-eyebrow>Gestão financeira</span><h1>Financeiro de <span id=financial-title-name>Nome do cliente</span></h1><p class=financial-subtitle>Gere e acompanhe os pagamentos relacionados a este cliente.</p></header><section class=financial-panel aria-labelledby=financial-payments-title><header class=financial-panel-heading><div class=financial-panel-heading-main><div class=financial-panel-icon><i class='fa fa-money' aria-hidden=true></i></div><div><h2 id=financial-payments-title>Pagamentos</h2><p>Cadastre pagamentos e acompanhe a quitação da entrada e das parcelas.</p></div></div><button id=financial-new-payment type=button><i class='fa fa-plus' aria-hidden=true></i> Gerar pagamento</button></header><p id=financial-feedback class=financial-feedback role=status></p><div id=financial-payments-list class=financial-payments-list></div></section><dialog id=financial-payment-dialog class=financial-payment-dialog aria-labelledby=financial-payment-dialog-title><form id=financial-payment-form method=dialog><header><h2 id=financial-payment-dialog-title>Gerar pagamento</h2><p>Defina as condições financeiras. Os valores das parcelas serão calculados automaticamente.</p></header><div class=financial-form-grid><label class=financial-field><span>Título <b aria-hidden=true>*</b></span><small>Identifica este pagamento para o administrador.</small><input id=financial-payment-title name=title type=text maxlength=160 required autocomplete=off></label><label class=financial-field><span>Valor total <b aria-hidden=true>*</b></span><small>Valor-base antes de desconto, entrada e juros.</small><input id=financial-payment-total name=totalAmount type=number min=0.01 step=0.01 inputmode=decimal required></label><label class=financial-field><span>Parcelas <b aria-hidden=true>*</b></span><small>Quantidade de parcelas do saldo, entre 1 e 120.</small><input id=financial-payment-count name=installmentCount type=number min=1 max=120 step=1 inputmode=numeric required></label><label class=financial-field><span>Entrada (%)</span><small>Percentual antecipado, calculado após o desconto.</small><input id=financial-payment-down name=downPaymentPercentage type=number min=0 max=100 step=0.01 inputmode=decimal></label><label class=financial-field><span>Desconto (%)</span><small>Percentual abatido do valor total.</small><input id=financial-payment-discount name=discountPercentage type=number min=0 max=100 step=0.01 inputmode=decimal></label><label class=financial-field><span>Juros (%)</span><small>Percentual adicionado ao saldo do pagamento a prazo.</small><input id=financial-payment-interest name=interestPercentage type=number min=0 max=100 step=0.01 inputmode=decimal></label></div><section id=financial-payment-preview class=financial-payment-preview hidden aria-live=polite><div class=financial-payment-preview-summary><span>Valor final <strong id=financial-preview-final>R$ 0,00</strong></span><span>Saldo restante <strong id=financial-preview-remaining>R$ 0,00</strong></span></div><h3>Entrada e parcelas</h3><p>Os status abaixo serão preservados ao editar o pagamento.</p><div id=financial-installments-editor class=financial-parts-list></div></section><p id=financial-payment-form-feedback class=financial-form-feedback role=alert></p><footer class=financial-dialog-actions><button id=financial-payment-cancel type=button>Cancelar</button><button id=financial-payment-save type=submit>Salvar pagamento</button></footer></form></dialog><div class=financial-actions><button id=financial-back type=button><i class='fa fa-arrow-left' aria-hidden=true></i> Voltar ao cliente</button></div></section>"
